DSEAMS

fix dseams reads the running LAMMPS atoms and calls libyodaLib through
seams_insitu.h. The header and the source are GPL-2.0-only because they
include LAMMPS headers. libyodaLib is not part of this package.

Enable the package with PKG_DSEAMS and pass the library location:

  -D PKG_DSEAMS=on
  -D SEAMS_INCLUDE=<directory that contains seams_insitu.h>
  -D SEAMS_LIBRARY=<path to libyodaLib.so>

The fix keyword host defaults to yes and uses the LAMMPS neighbour list.
host no leaves that list unused so the engine builds its own.
